我們既領受了合一的聖事，求你使我們在一切事上，都能承行你的聖意。正如聖瑪爾定主教曾全心服從你，求你也幫助我們把自己完全交託給你，並以作你的忠僕為榮。因主耶穌基督之名，求你俯聽我們的祈禱。亞孟。","yale":["seuhng","jyú",null,"ngóh","mùhn","gei","líhng","sauh","líuh","hahp","yāt","dīk","sing","sih",null,"kàuh","néih","sí","ngóh","mùhn","joih","yāt","chai","sih","seuhng",null,"dōu","nàhng","sìhng","hàahng","néih","dīk","sing","yi",null,"jing","yùh","sing","máh","yíh","dihng","jyú","gaau","chàhng","chyùhn","sām","fuhk","chùhng","néih",null,"kàuh","néih","yáh","bōng","joh","ngóh","mùhn","bá","jih","géi","yùhn","chyùhn","gāau","tok","kāp","néih",null,"bihng","yíh","jok","néih","dīk","jūng","buhk","waih","wìhng",null,"yān","jyú","yèh","sōu","gēi","dūk","jī","méng",null,"kàuh","néih","fú","tēng","ngóh","mùhn","dīk","kèih","tóu",null,"a","màhng",null]}],"proper":true,"en":{"source":"iBreviary","citation":null,"lines":["Grant to us who have been restored","by this Sacrament of unity, O Lord,","perfect harmony with your will in all things,","that, just as Saint Martin submitted himself entirely to you,","so we, too, may glory in being truly yours.","Through Christ our Lord."]},"la":{"source":"iBreviary","citation":null,"lines":["Da nobis, Dómine, unitátis sacraménto reféctis,","perféctam in ómnibus cum tua voluntáte concórdiam,","ut, sicut beátus Martínus totum se tibi subiécit,","ita et nos esse tui veráciter gloriémur.","Per Christum Dóminum nostrum."]}}]}